{
  "id": "2SA.13",
  "number": "13",
  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "2 Samweli 13",
  "verseCount": 39,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amnoni sea Damari",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Absalomu was orjeeda Dawdi, abeeda gwandeawa huda ghaamwat miy siguura gheawungaaschi Damari; iimuchu ghabwariiy Amnoni was orjeeda Dawdi huda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwahinda geaw Amnoni gili miyaan aba badayda huda ghaamwat siguura Damari; abeeda miyeegeanu, ak ghwaraay Amnoni gichea gwahinda huda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Amnoni gwandeawa siida duupchi, siguura gheawungaaschi Yonadabu, was orjeeda Shimeya, was orjeeda geenyea Dawdi; nea Yonadabu ea siida milmili muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwalamda ak gwayeesha siidida, “Ea orjeeda sugoocheanda, ghwasaan ang'iing'i inyas girbi giliwas sakteayda? Giheawi rukuneani?” Hean gwayeesha Amnoni niny, “Aniini ghaabwariinyi Damari was huda geenyea orjeeda giyeanya siguura Absalomu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yonadabu ak gwayeesha, “Asi wiila geaw aba badayda bulaliidaang'u, ak gwahinda geaw gili miyaan; ama hidu gweanu nea gagasa ghwadaanyi, giyeeshi niny, ‘Nung' ghwaan huda giyeanya was Damari gagoonan mukaate daak, ak goowooschi nea geang'ulayi, ak ghaayaaji aba geatingaaschi.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawiil geaw Amnoni, aba ng'eanyi ak gwahinda geaw gili miyaan, iidu nea ghwahidu sugoocheanda ghwadaah, gwayeesha Amnoni sugoocheanda, “Geamuscheey nung' ghwaan huda giyeanya was Damari goowoolnean mukaatajeesu ng'ay nea geang'ulayi, ak ghaayaakti geatingaaschi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeakta Dawdi siida gawa ghoah heeda Damari, ak gwayeesha, “Una gheeda orjeeda giyeang'wa was Amnoni, ak giiwoolsi hamita jea ghwaak.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat Damari gawa gheeda orjeeda ghaamwat was Amnoni, nea abeeda gawiil geaw. Gageanu dearanga ak gwasin, ak ghoawu mukaate aba madeadaanyi, ak ghoaghajaam aba nagheeda mukaatajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu dahuuda ak ghwayiin madeadaanyi, ak ghaheawa ghwaak. Ghwalamda Amnoni ak gwayeesha, “Oang'aamwana buuneesean heedeanyu.” Ak gwarita buuneesean ak geenung'usa heeda niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Amnoni Damari, “Eani hamita jeeda ghooriida, ak ghaayaaji hamita geatingaagu.” Ak gageanu Damari mukaatajeega gwachi sin, ak ghwaat jeeda ghooriida heeda mida orjeeda ghaamwat was Amnoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gweadu murdeadaanyi gweagiischi, ghoang'waay huda, ak gwayeesha, “Beeni, eeluudayeena huda giyeanya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha huda ak gwayeesha, “Manda, orjeeda giyeanya, adidiing'sean; aba gideaba ng'asheanda sunu miyeesin aba Israeli; adiidu gisini ng'asheanda leendeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda aniini, gaydeageal eenu baspaseesu? Ak eara ang'iing'i gajuurjeewana siitasha aba jeeda fuga Israeli. Asi geamuscheey ghamneawa, musa sugoocheanda ak ea mayghaheawa gideaba gaygheanaan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaheawa niny gooleeysiit ng'asheagaaschi; iidu nea ghwadaah niny gaburdeawa uurda huda, ghoang'waay aba uurda, ak gwaluudayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu ghwasit Amnoni huda muuchi; ea ghwanaawa sicheeda sit huda bariinyeega ghayi bwariiy huda. Ak ghwalamda Amnoni ak gwayeesha huda, “Ng'eada, ak guwi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha huda niny, “Manda, orjeeda giyeanya; gideaba ginung' dabeadunu nih giidiinyeanda haw muuchi gil ea ghwanaawa gidagwachi isimanean aniini.” Ak ea mooleeysiina iit huda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaguursa siidida gwachi gadiyeesean ak gwayeesha, “Ang'aamwana gatmooni madeedeanyu, ak gijabi gidaghuuta iirita.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda niny gooshuup geaw hang'da mideawa geatinga geawi; was gea akweali haweega miyeaghi bea sugoodiga. Hit ghwanung' siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda gwarita jarooda, ak ghwajap gidaghuuta iirita huda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu Damari deareeda ak ghwayiin uhuudaanyi, ak ghabwaash hang'da geaw gwachi akwa; ak ghwayiin geatingaaschi uhuudaanyi, ak ghang'eat gawa, nea gooyeawdeada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha orjeeda ghaamwat was Absalomu huda, “Neada orjeeda geamadu was Amnoni gwachi gindeawi? Asi siinda, huda giyeanya; niny orjeeda giyeang'wa; adiidu giyiini ng'asheanji jeadaang'u.” Hean goopteadayda Damari gatmooda nea gagiisan, aba jeeda gheeda orjeeda ghaamwat was Absalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghwayiiy sugoocheanda was Dawdi iiteaba ng'asheesu seaniin, ghwanyareas muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu goobaloola Absalomu Amnoni ng'asheega mii miyaasiin ghana gea munyas; aba gideaba nisit Absalomu Amnoni, aba gideaba nibwaay huda ghaamwat was Damari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Absalomu ghawalda mureandooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gweanyeeka muguuri iyeenya gwandeawa Absalomu fuga laja buudeega gisilga aba ng'eanyiida Baal-hasori, neekeewa Efraimu, ak gaguursa Absalomu orjooga sean bea sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa Absalomu heeda sugoocheanda, ak gwayeesha, “Ng'ula, siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda gwandeawa fuga laja buudeega gisilga; geamuscheey nung' goodeayi sugoocheanda sea fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda sea siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda sugoocheanda ak gwayeesha Absalomu, “Manda orjeedeanyu, adiidu geeweayi eesa sean, aba gideaba gajiidu geahuuyi sareenda aba headaang'u.” Hean gamus muuchi niny, ak ea mawa ak ghoadaw ghawooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Absalomu niny, “Iimajeeteayeena, gimusi orjeeda giyeanya was Amnoni eeteayeewana.” Ak gwayeesha sugoocheanda niny, “Ghwasaan inyas gajooteayeewana niny?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gamus Absalomu niny ea ghamwas goodeayi Amnoni sea orjooga sean bea sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarukusa Absalomu fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda gideaba, “Ooroora damanda jea gahoosana guroorooda Amnoni aba difaayi, ak geayeeshiineey, ‘Lasa Amnoni,’ abeeda gibwari ghami. Asi adibeali; neada ea mearukuneeyi aniini? Ameanyiita nea goodarusiidayi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasima fuga gadiyeeda Absalomu Amnoni gidarukusa Absalomu. Ak ghang'eat ng'eat orjooga sean bea sugoocheanda, ak gaba siisi ding'da nghataanyi ak gamng'aw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda mideewa naweeda, ghwahidu iita heeda Dawdi, gideaba, “Absalomu nibwar orjooga sean bea sugoocheanda, ak ea moapta eara akaleala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat sugoocheanda, ak ghabwaashaada hang'weakaaschi, ak gawiil geaw aba ng'eanyi; nea fugaaschi sean bea gadiyeeda gwachi miinaada ghabwaashaada hang'weaka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Yonadabu orjeeda Shimeya, was orjeeda geenyea Dawdi, gwayi, “Adaghaghay ng'utamiideanyu gili naabwarji gheareemanga sean was orjooga sugoocheanda, aba gideaba ghami Amnoni nea gaba geaw, iidu aba ng'asheanda rugu Absalomu geebay eanal ng'asheanda damanda bwaanya huda ghaamwat siguura Damari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa gidabal ea mwayiina ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda jeadaanyi ak ghaghay gili nimeewa orjooga sean bea sugoocheanda; aba gideaba ghami Amnoni nea gaba geaw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gamng'aw Absalomu. Nea abeeda gheareemaneeda furiischi gagatkat gheanyangaaschi, ak ghoang'wearda, ak ging'ulayi, ghapka fuga saang'a eadu naweeda Horonaimu sigu murdeeda giijeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yonadabu ak gwayeesha sugoocheanda, “Ng'ula, orjooga sugoocheanda nupka; gawuurji gidanyaashta siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda, ak ghamneawa ea nisa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghoahiit baloolda, ging'ulayi, ghwahidu orjooga sugoocheanda, ak ghwajaat ghuusiga nyaawa ak gooyeawda nea goojuur; ak eara sugoocheanda sea fugaaschi sean bea gadiyeeda gooyeawda aba ng'weaniidooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gamng'aw Absalomu, ak gawa heeda Dalmayi orjeeda Amihudi, was sugoocheanda Geshuri. Ak gooyeawda Dawdi orjeedaanyi giliwas eaweecha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gamng'aw Absalomu ak gawa ng'eanyiida Geshuri, ak goobiida hoowa gweanyeew samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gagasa guroorooda sugoocheanda gawa heeda Absalomu aba gideaba nihawda aba iita Amnoni, aba gideaba nimi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
